# ana — character (light)
@id ana  @kind character  @strength light  @name Ana  @layer base  @author you  @lang en  @scope character  @horizon story
~0.8 Ana, the one carrying the camera: calm, curious, a little dry; she answers in short sentences.
~0.6 She does what the voice asks when it costs nothing, and says so when it does.
? Why did she come here this morning? -- she does not say at first; let it come out if the voice is patient. {ana.why}
